{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000cbf1","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0b17d-598e-7f80-b6bd-728e9f57759a"},"sequence":1107,"recorded_at":1780531400002209,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"ee667c6e-43c2-4b33-805c-7f4df74b7dba","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"ee667c6e-43c2-4b33-805c-7f4df74b7dba","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"ee667c6e-43c2-4b33-805c-7f4df74b7dba"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a0b182-adaf-7583-a7d2-e69b99772696"},"task_id":"01a0b182-adaf-7583-a7d2-e69b99772696","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a0b182-adaf-7583-a7d2-e69b99772696","chunk":"{\n  \"chunk_id\": \"exec-41-1\",\n  \"command\": \"go test ./internal/traceability -run TestZZMeasureV070Clauses -v -count=1 2>&1 | head -80\",\n  \"description\": \"Run clause measurement probe\",\n  \"exit_code\": 0,\n  \"terminal_status\": \"completed\",\n  \"output\": \"=== RUN   TestZZMeasureV070Clauses\\n=== section:11.2 total=5 ===\\n11.2#1 line=7320 text=\\\"The first request MUST be <code>hello</code>:\\\"\\n11.2#2 line=7364 text=\\\"state, Structured Error, Observation Event, and CLI Result MUST NOT appear in\\\"\\n11.2#3 line=7408 text=\\\"<code>ok = false</code> and one Structured Error and MUST omit body. Unknown\\\"\\n11.2#4 line=7420 text=\\\"at least the values shown and MUST refuse a peer below them. The 5 MiB object\\\"\\n11.2#5 line=7425 text=\\\"that code locally, exactly as Section 15.1 requires. A peer MUST NOT\\\"\\n=== section:11.3 total=27 ===\\n11.3#1 line=7460 text=\\\"also includes an exact lease expectation. The receiver MUST revalidate both\\\"\\n11.3#2 line=7493 text=\\\"<code>ownership_transfer_session_ids</code> is a subset. It MUST be empty for\\\"\\n11.3#3 line=7495 text=\\\"and MUST be non-empty for <code>ownership_transfer</code>. The request's <code>session_id</code> is in\\\"\\n11.3#4 line=7523 text=\\\"source IDs MUST be in the selected Checkpoint closure, and the generated\\\"\\n11.3#5 line=7524 text=\\\"Materialization Plan kind and intent MUST equal the request.\\\"\\n11.3#6 line=7535 text=\\\"boundary may carry either as null. Process handles are operation-local opaque values and MUST NOT be\\\"\\n11.3#7 line=7589 text=\\\"The caller MUST allocate <code>materialize.prepare.operation_id</code> and\\\"\\n11.3#8 line=7590 text=\\\"<code>materialization_id</code> before the first request and MUST retain them\\\"\\n11.3#9 line=7592 text=\\\"receiver MUST durably create the Materialization Journal with both IDs and a\\\"\\n11.3#10 line=7596 text=\\\"success or failure and MUST NOT allocate a second journal, staging authority,\\\"\\n11.3#11 line=7601 text=\\\"RPC envelope <code>request_id</code> only for correlation, and MUST return the\\\"\\n11.3#12 line=7604 text=\\\"The prepare response MUST echo the request kind and intent. For\\\"\\n11.3#13 line=7607 text=\\\"Commit, status, finalize, and rollback MUST return the identical kind/intent\\\"\\n11.3#14 line=7625 text=\\\"A passive finalization MUST NOT start/adopt a provider, enable\\\"\\n11.3#15 line=7629 text=\\\"rollbackable <code>prepared</code> phase and MUST durably write the Section 10.6\\\"\\n11.3#16 line=7636 text=\\\"the caller MUST NOT perform those bridge mutations out of band.\\\"\\n11.3#17 line=7648 text=\\\"<code>failed</code> and retains both recovery roots. Lost responses MUST be\\\"\\n11.3#18 line=7734 text=\\\"Arrays with digest identities MUST be sorted bytewise and contain no duplicate.\\\"\\n11.3#19 line=7736 text=\\\"characters; a receiver MUST reject a prefix outside that range. One\\\"\\n11.3#20 line=7737 text=\\\"<code>objects.get</code> response MUST remain within the negotiated line limit;\\\"\\n11.3#21 line=7740 text=\\\"Every <code>session.*</code> and <code>handoff.*</code> mutation MUST be\\\"\\n11.3#22 line=7742 text=\\\"operation and MUST revalidate the expected fencing token immediately before\\\"\\n11.3#23 line=7744 text=\\\"For <code>handoff.prepare</code>, both cohort arrays MUST be non-empty and equal;\\\"\\n11.3#24 line=7745 text=\\\"the current <code>session_id</code> MUST be a member. The receiver stores the\\\"\\n11.3#25 line=7754 text=\\\"advances, recovery MUST finish or explicitly recover every remaining cohort\\\"\\n11.3#26 line=7755 text=\\\"member; it MUST NOT resume a stopped source member into the shared checkout.\\\"\\n11.3#27 line=7759 text=\\\"lease to the source. It MUST validate the complete Lease Record, require the\\\"\\n=== section:17.1 total=6 ===\\n17.1#1 line=15567 text=\\\"- a major increment MAY break syntax or semantics and MUST require explicit\\\"\\n17.1#2 line=15570 text=\\\"extension fields but MUST preserve all prior semantics;\\\"\\n17.1#3 line=15586 text=\\\"Within any negotiated major version, new object data MUST live under a namespaced\\\"\\n17.1#4 line=15589 text=\\\"highest mutually supported minor within a common major; they MUST NOT select a\\\"\\n17.1#5 line=15602 text=\\\"immutable v0.1.0 contracts and MUST NOT be interpreted using the corrected\\\"\\n17.1#6 line=15604 text=\\\"machine-local 1.0.0 materialization transaction: upgrade MUST first reach a\\\"\\n=== section:17.4 total=4 ===\\n17.4#1 line=15647 text=\\\"After upgrade it MUST run schema/plugin/task-board compatibility checks before\\\"\\n17.4#2 line=15650 text=\\\"A downgraded binary that cannot understand current records MUST enter\\\"\\n17.4#3 line=15651 text=\\\"read-only diagnostic mode for those sessions. It MUST NOT resume, transfer\\\"\\n17.4#4 line=15661 text=\\\"immutable evidence; it MUST report activation unavailable rather than omit the\\\"\\n--- PASS: TestZZMeasureV070Clauses (0.01s)\\nPASS\\nok  \\tgithub.com/relux-works/agent-session-manager/internal/traceability\\t0.358s\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 4481,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 1121,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","final_result":true}}}
