no-coercion shapes through the composed `Negotiate` entry; the\\nfuzz targets below reach the `hello`/`inventory.roots` body parsers rather\\nthan only the envelope. Twenty-two of the twenty-four Section 11.3\\noperation bodies stay opaque by design and are stated bounds, not rows.\\n\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 1300,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 325,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","final_result":true}}}
