{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000d629","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0b17d-598e-7f80-b6bd-728e9f57759a"},"sequence":2415,"recorded_at":1780531400004825,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"ee667c6e-43c2-4b33-805c-7f4df74b7dba","payload_type":"tool.result","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"tool_result","command_id":"ee667c6e-43c2-4b33-805c-7f4df74b7dba","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"ee667c6e-43c2-4b33-805c-7f4df74b7dba"},"call_id":"call_01a0b1887f277063bdb5b68ae1800629","text":"Read text file `internal/matjournal/rpc_replay_test.go`.\n1|package matjournal\n2|\n3|import (\n4|\t\"bytes\"\n5|\t\"os\"\n6|\t\"testing\"\n7|)\n8|\n9|// TestRPCBlindRetryAfterCommitNeverDoubles is the lost-response recovery\n10|// proof for the Mesh RPC materialize.status entry (Section 11.3): the\n11|// status read locates the one journal by caller-known materialization ID\n12|// and returns the current reconciled durable phase, while a blind retry of\n13|// the prepare after a committed effect replays the recorded receipt instead\n14|// of doubling the mutation. Driven through the production Create, Get, and\n15|// Transition entries.\n16|func TestRPCBlindRetryAfterCommitNeverDoubles(t *testing.T) {\n17|\tstore := openTestStore(t)\n18|\tsetupPhase(t, store, PhaseCommitted)\n19|\n20|\tcurrent, stored, err := store.Get(testMatID)\n21|\tif err != nil {\n22|\t\tt.Fatal(err)\n23|\t}\n24|\tif current.Phase != PhaseCommitted {\n25|\t\tt.Fatalf(\"Get phase = %q, want committed (the true durable phase, not a stale observation)\", current.Phase)\n26|\t}\n27|\tentries, err := os.ReadDir(store.root)\n28|\tif err != nil {\n29|\t\tt.Fatal(err)\n30|\t}\n31|\tif len(entries) != 1 {\n32|\t\tt.Fatalf(\"journal directories = %d, want exactly one\", len(entries))\n33|\t}\n34|\n35|\t// The client lost the prepare result and retries blindly with the\n36|\t// identical canonical body: the recorded receipt replays.\n37|\tagain, raw, err := store.Create(testInputs())\n38|\tif err != nil {\n39|\t\tt.Fatalf(\"blind retry Create error = %v\", err)\n40|\t}\n41|\tif again.MaterializationID != testMatID || again.Phase != PhaseCommitted {\n42|\t\tt.Fatalf(\"blind retry ref = %+v, want the committed receipt\", again)\n43|\t}\n44|\tif !bytes.Equal(raw, stored) {\n45|\t\tt.Fatal(\"blind retry replayed bytes differ from the recorded journal\")\n46|\t}\n47|\tentries, err = os.ReadDir(store.root)\n48|\tif err != nil {\n49|\t\tt.Fatal(err)\n50|\t}\n51|\tif len(entries) != 1 {\n52|\t\tt.Fatalf(\"blind retry left %d journal directories, want exactly one (no second journal)\", len(entries))\n53|\t}\n54|\tafter, _, err := store.Get(testMatID)\n55|\tif err != nil {\n56|\t\tt.Fatal(err)\n57|\t}\n58|\tif after.Phase != PhaseCommitted {\n59|\t\tt.Fatalf(\"Get phase after retry = %q, want committed\", after.Phase)\n60|\t}\n61|}","correlation_facts":{"tool_name":"read_file","outcome":"success"}}}
